        "id": "commands",
        "title": "Ebiragiro by’omu ffumbiro",
        "body": [
          "Ebiragiro bitandika n’ekikolwa: **Put the pot on the fire. Add oil. Cut the onions.** Okwongera obuntu: **Please**, **a little**: **Add a little salt, please.**"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "first-then",
        "title": "First, then …",
        "body": [
          "Okulaga omutendera: **First** (sooka), **then** (oluvannyuma), **after that**, **finally**: **First cut the onions. Then add the tomatoes.**"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "culture": [
      {
        "title": "“Webale okufumba”",
        "body": [
          "Mu Lungereza osobola okugamba **Thanks for cooking!**, naye abantu batera okutendereza emmere: **The food is delicious!** **Thank you for the meal.**"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "stories": [
    {
      "id": "cooking-luwombo",
      "title": "Okufumba ne Jjajja",
      "unlockAfter": "u24s3l3",
      "cast": ["amara", "jjajja"],
      "summary": "Amara ayiga okufumba luwombo w’enkoko.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "jjajja",
            "target": "Today we will cook chicken luwombo.",
            "base": "Leero tujja kufumba luwombo lw’enkoko."
          }
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "amara",
            "target": "Okay! What do I do?",
            "base": "Kale! Nkola ki?"
          }
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "jjajja",
            "target": "First cut the onions and the tomatoes.",
            "base": "Sooka sala obutungulu n’ennyaanya."
          }
        },
        {
          "question": "Amara asooka kukola ki?",
          "options": [
            "Cut onions and tomatoes",
            "Light the fire",
            "Wash the pot"
          ],
          "optionsLang": "target",
          "answer": 0
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "amara",
            "target": "Done! What next?",
            "base": "Mmaze! Oluvannyuma?"
          }
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "jjajja",
            "target": "Put the chicken and the sauce in banana leaves, and wrap them well.",
            "base": "Teeka enkoko n’enva mu ndagala, osibe bulungi."
          }
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "jjajja",
            "target": "Then we put the pot on the fire, for two hours.",
            "base": "Oluvannyuma tuteeka entamu ku muliro, essaawa bbiri."
          }
        },
        {
          "question": "Luwombo afumbibwa bbanga ki?",
          "options": ["Ten minutes", "Two hours", "All night"],
          "optionsLang": "target",
          "answer": 1
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "amara",
            "target": "Two hours? I’m very hungry!",
            "base": "Essaawa bbiri? Nnina enjala nnyo!"
          }
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "jjajja",
            "target": "Haha! The food is ready. Let’s eat!",
            "base": "Haha! Emmere eyidde. Tulye!"
          }
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "amara",
            "target": "It’s very tasty! Thanks for cooking, Grandma.",
            "base": "Kiwooma nnyo! Webale okufumba, Jjajja."
          }
        },
        {
          "question": "Mu Lungereza Amara agamba ki ng’amaze okulya?",
          "options": ["Thanks for cooking", "First cut", "I’m waiting for you"],
          "optionsLang": "target",
          "answer": 0
        }
      ]
    }
